        "slc_966513be6016781a1fe9425ff366bbf5fdca66b85745037a550504a4fe67a59c"
      ],
      "text": "The file targets the AGENTS.md open standard: tools like Codex, Cursor, Aider, Windsurf, Copilot, and Devin read it natively, while Claude Code and Gemini CLI require CLAUDE.md and GEMINI.md symlinks (or copies) pointing to it."
    },
