        "slc_c2c0c4ac9c4978a5395980980e2190eb4bc69588a41176eef71264c7bd20f70c"
      ],
      "text": "Installation is documented two ways: an agent-driven prompt that fetches the raw file, symlinks CLAUDE.md/GEMINI.md, and fills section 10 from the codebase, or a manual curl download of AGENTS.md."
    },
